{%- set page = nav.pages['downloads'] -%}
{{ page_header(page, 'Local downloads of the data embedded in this file. Nothing is fetched or uploaded.') }}
<p>All exports use data embedded in this document. Full-cohort and filtered exports are labelled separately. Matrices keep supplied values and labels; figures retain their scale and caveats.</p>
<div data-cf-download-centre class="cf-download-grid"></div>
<noscript><p>Local downloads require JavaScript. Source records and numeric tables remain readable in their sections; use your browser’s print command to save the complete report.</p></noscript>
<p class="muted">Use each figure’s SVG button for a vector export. PNG export is available in the figure toolbar where supported. Source tables offer CSV export of visible rows.</p>
{{ page_footer(page) }}
